---
title: Roast chicken thighs with carrots
servings: 4
tags: [weeknight, one-pan]
source: Invented for this repository
---

Heat the oven to 220°C.

Toss the @carrots{600%g}, cut into batons, with @olive oil{1%tbsp} and a good
pinch of @flaked sea salt{} in a #roasting tin{}.

Sit the @chicken thighs{8} on top, skin up, and season them well. Roast
~{40%minutes} until the skin is dark and the carrots have taken colour at the
edges.

Rest ~{10%minutes} in the tin. Spoon the pan juices over before serving.
